Operation	HTTP Method	URL	Notes
Create Employee	    POST	http://localhost:8080/api/employees	                                        Pass employee details in JSON body.
Get All Employees	GET	    http://localhost:8080/api/employees	                                        Fetches all employees.
Get Employee by ID	GET  	http://localhost:8080/api/employees/{id}                                    Replace {id} with employee ID.
Update Employee	    PUT	    http://localhost:8080/api/employees/{id}	                                Update details in JSON body.
Delete Employee	    DELETE	http://localhost:8080/api/employees/{id}                                    Replace {id} with employee ID.
Add Salary Hike	    PUT	    http://localhost:8080/api/employees/{id}/hike?hikePercentage={percentage}	Add hike percentage in the query.


